The  driver  provides  support for IrDA frame level transmission.
It does not contain the IrDA protocol stack per se, but the stack
can be built on top of the driver.  Access to frames is  via  the
and  system  calls.   Each  write constitutes one frame, and each
read yields one frame.  The system call can be used to check  for
availability  of frames.  There are also a number of calls to ma‐
